    {
      "id": "Q105",
      "answer": "No. Shadows' conditional targeting ability changes only the numeric Range used to choose the land target, leaving internal Range arrows unchanged. General Power Range bonuses can affect printed Range values in a Power's targeting box and effect text, subject to all restrictions, but do not increase a Range bonus itself and do not apply to another Spirit's Powers merely because they target the boosted Spirit. Neither waives other source/target restrictions.",
