END_SLICE [36000,42000)

SLICE /home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/spirit-island/2026-11-05-batch-002957/expanded-v14/answer-key.json [42000,48000) sha256=c2a6caf09d768392a63ae1e3b3c3f2d6bdcc85d65c5c4929d3b33b4337e80170
nefit is uncovered by that loss.",
      "source_refs": [
        "CORE pp.5,13,15"
      ]
