      "answer": "For a land-targeting Power, measure the internal arrow from the target land unless otherwise specified. For a Spirit-targeting Power, normally measure from the Presence of the Spirit following the instruction, B here, unless the text says otherwise. Apply the bonuses of the Power user A, not B: the stated Range 1 becomes Range 3 from B’s Presence. Blazing Renewal explicitly measures from the Power user A’s Presence, even
END_SLICE [42000,48000)

SLICE /home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/spirit-island/2026-11-05-batch-002957/expanded-v14/answer-key.json [48000,54000) sha256=c2a6caf09d768392a63ae1e3b3c3f2d6bdcc85d65c5c4929d3b33b4337e80170
 when B adds Presence; its explicit origin overrides the default.",
