    {
      "id": "Q141",
      "answer": "For a simultaneous instruction select the pieces first, then replace them at the same time; the same original piece cannot be downgraded twice within that instruction. Separate completed instructions/actions may downgrade the resulting piece again, so successive legal Trade Suffers player actions can do so.",
