        "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/batches/2026-11-05-batch-002957/source-preflight/spirit-island/living-faq-core-game.txt | FAQ chaining-upgrades-and-downgrades: simultaneous versus separate replacements | SHA256 874741b896dd163568a7e33ee4341fe7b38db9a2834185d272d662573de3679e | Unicode chars 35101:36026 | passage SHA256 4cad9229f6821364fa7bdecd5d2e9601cb4cf918e93de3c7501f0a5fdff257fa",
