      "answer": "It Ravages from the second matching card. Each card determines its own affected-land list immediately before resolving that card; the first card’s fixed list does not lock eligibility for later cards.",
      "source_refs": [
        "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/batches/2026-11-05-batch-002957/source-preflight/spirit-island/living-faq-core-game.txt | FAQ pieces-added-or-moved-by-ravages-do-not-cause-more-ravages: another Ravage Card can act in newly occupied lands | SHA256 874741b896dd163568a7e33ee4341fe7b38db9a2834185d272d662573de3679e | Unicode chars 77620:79164 | passage SHA256 1d58632377fc4a2a744123eddaab67e43aa558b3c064b3b7dfe9f5d0df2dbbf6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q143",
      "answer": "Use unmodified printed Health and ignore all Health modifiers, temporary or permanent, for the Energy exchange.",
      "source_refs": [
        "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/batches/2026-11-05-batch-002957/source-preflight/spirit-island/living-faq-core-game.txt | FAQ .9v5ka9g: ignore all Invader Health modifiers when trading | SHA256 874741b896dd163568a7e33ee4341fe7b38db9a2834185d272d662573de3679e | Unicode chars 195463:196249 | passage SHA256 e36aa1d9f57b7411f65d529a29f724d99af75a3eb49988d7b2ce29fc5dbd321a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q144",
      "answer": "Its instruction says to Push the Explorers to as many different lands as possible. With three Explorers and three legal lands, use all three destinations. With only two legal lands, use both, putting the remaining Explorer in one of them.",
